{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And I will strengthen</b> — Judah and Joseph are those who come from Assyria to the Second Temple." "<b>And I will restore them</b> — A compound word from והשיבותים and הושבתים, just as שבועות ימים is from שבעת and שבוע, and many others likewise."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {0 "Resolved בית שני as 'the Second Temple'; the phrase may alternatively refer to 'a second house,' but the standard reference is to the Second Temple."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:38.258307004Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}